{"SurveyEntry":{"SurveyID":"SV_9oTFuww0AbvGJzD","SurveyName":"Standard MES - Crimston et al 2016","SurveyDescription":null,"SurveyOwnerID":"UR_cZucPLCJh2Shr6Z","SurveyBrandID":"uqpsych","DivisionID":null,"SurveyLanguage":"EN","SurveyActiveResponseSet":"RS_3xZ5JdbO2VUx9zv","SurveyStatus":"Active","SurveyStartDate":"0000-00-00 00:00:00","SurveyExpirationDate":"0000-00-00 00:00:00","SurveyCreationDate":"2017-07-17 20:03:55","CreatorID":"UR_cZucPLCJh2Shr6Z","LastModified":"2018-08-05 19:45:54","LastAccessed":"0000-00-00 00:00:00","LastActivated":"2017-08-10 20:57:58","Deleted":null},"SurveyElements":[{"SurveyID":"SV_9oTFuww0AbvGJzD","Element":"BL","PrimaryAttribute":"Survey Blocks","SecondaryAttribute":null,"TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":[{"Type":"Default","Description":"MES Intro","ID":"BL_5cjmqb04zQv6wxn","BlockElements":[{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID2"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID3"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID5"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID6"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID8"}]},{"Type":"Trash","Description":"Trash \/ Unused Questions","ID":"BL_8J7oysePsjVdO29","BlockElements":[{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID1"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID4"},{"Type":"Question","QuestionID":"QID7"}]}]},{"SurveyID":"SV_9oTFuww0AbvGJzD","Element":"FL","PrimaryAttribute":"Survey Flow","SecondaryAttribute":null,"TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"Flow":[{"ID":"BL_5cjmqb04zQv6wxn","Type":"Block","FlowID":"FL_2"}],"Properties":{"Count":2},"FlowID":"FL_1","Type":"Root"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9oTFuww0AbvGJzD","Element":"SO","PrimaryAttribute":"Survey Options","SecondaryAttribute":null,"TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"BackButton":"false","SaveAndContinue":"true","SurveyProtection":"PublicSurvey","BallotBoxStuffingPrevention":"false","NoIndex":"Yes","SecureResponseFiles":"true","SurveyExpiration":"None","SurveyTermination":"DefaultMessage","Header":"","Footer":"","ProgressBarDisplay":"None","PartialData":"+1 week","ValidationMessage":"","PreviousButton":"  <<  ","NextButton":"  >>  ","SkinLibrary":"uqpsych","SkinType":"MQ","Skin":"skin2","NewScoring":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9oTFuww0AbvGJzD","Element":"SCO","PrimaryAttribute":"Scoring","SecondaryAttribute":null,"TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"ScoringCategories":[{"ID":"SC_d5qkrLaN25Gilsp","Name":"MES_total","Description":""}],"ScoringCategoryGroups":[],"DefaultScoringCategory":"SC_d5qkrLaN25Gilsp","ScoringSummaryCategory":"SC_d5qkrLaN25Gilsp","ScoringSummaryAfterQuestions":0,"ScoringSummaryAfterSurvey":0,"AutoScoringCategory":null,"IgnoreNullValues":true}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9oTFuww0AbvGJzD","Element":"STAT","PrimaryAttribute":"Survey Statistics","SecondaryAttribute":null,"TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"MobileCompatible":false,"ID":"Survey Statistics"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9oTFuww0AbvGJzD","Element":"PROJ","PrimaryAttribute":"CORE","SecondaryAttribute":"1.0.0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":null},{"SurveyID":"SV_9oTFuww0AbvGJzD","Element":"QC","PrimaryAttribute":"Survey Question Count","SecondaryAttribute":"8","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":null},{"SurveyID":"SV_9oTFuww0AbvGJzD","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID2","SecondaryAttribute":"\u00a0\u00a0 Moral Circles \u00a0 People sometimes talk about 'circles of moral concern'. These circles are simp","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><u><span style=\"font-size:19px;\"><strong>Moral Circles<\/strong><\/span><\/u><br>\n&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">People sometimes talk about <strong>'<em>circles of moral concern<\/em>'<\/strong>. These circles are simple ways to make sense of the <em>levels of moral consideration we have for different entities<\/em> (e.g., people, animals, and the environment).<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\n<strong>Where we place these entities within our moral circles is important and has direct consequences for how we treat them.<\/strong> For example, you might have close family or friends that are central to your moral world, this means you would be willing to make personal sacrifices for them. However, if we do not include an entity within our moral circles, this means we do not believe they are deserving of moral care and consideration, and wouldn\u2019t want to make sacrifices for them.<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nOn the following page you are given the opportunity to organise a range of entities and place them within your own moral circles that reflect your individual views and feelings.<\/span><br><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q3","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"\u00a0\u00a0 Moral Circles \u00a0 People sometimes talk about 'circles of moral concern'. These circles are simp...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID2","DataVisibility":{"Private":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9oTFuww0AbvGJzD","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DataExportTag":"Q1","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID1"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9oTFuww0AbvGJzD","Element":"RS","PrimaryAttribute":"RS_3xZ5JdbO2VUx9zv","SecondaryAttribute":"Default Response Set","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":null},{"SurveyID":"SV_9oTFuww0AbvGJzD","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID8","SecondaryAttribute":"Having carefully read these descriptions, please consider the level of moral concern you personal...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><i>Having carefully read these descriptions<\/i>, please consider the <b>level of moral concern you personally have for each of the entities below<\/b>&nbsp;<\/span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\">and drop each one into the appropriate moral circle box on the right.&nbsp;<\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br><\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please note, there are no right or wrong answers - we just want to know your opinion.<\/span><\/div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br><\/span><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"MES","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"DND","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","NumColumns":1,"ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"Stack":"ON","MobileFirst":false},"QuestionDescription":"Having carefully read these descriptions, please consider the level of moral concern you personal...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:13px;\">family member<\/span>","ExclusiveAnswer":false},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:13px;\">close friend<\/span>","ExclusiveAnswer":false},"3":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:13px;\">partner\/spouse<\/span>","ExclusiveAnswer":false},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:13px;\">citizen of your country<\/span>","ExclusiveAnswer":false},"5":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:13px;\">somebody from your neighbourhood<\/span>","ExclusiveAnswer":false},"6":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:13px;\">co-worker<\/span>","ExclusiveAnswer":false},"7":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:13px;\">foreign citizen<\/span>","ExclusiveAnswer":false},"8":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:13px;\">supporter of opposing political party<\/span>","ExclusiveAnswer":